{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"42":"Model Behavior of the Prophet (Kitab Al-Sunnah)"},"section_detail":{"42":{"hadithnumber_first":4596,"hadithnumber_last":4772,"arabicnumber_first":4596,"arabicnumber_last":4772,"name_native":"كتاب السنة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4741,"arabicnumber":4741,"text":"حدثنا عثمان بن ابي شيبة، حدثنا جرير، عن الاعمش، عن ابي سفيان، عن جابر، قال سمعت النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول : \" ان اهل الجنة ياكلون فيها ويشربون","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim (2835)"}],"reference":{"book":42,"hadith":146}}]}